      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A novel UV transparent conducting films based on Sb2O3/Ag/Sb2O3 (SAS) structure, which were prepared by an electron-beam thermal evaporation at room temperature. This SAS exhibits excellent electrical, optical and stable properties. Especially for UV region, the SAS has high transmittance of 80% at 306\u2009nm and 92% at 335\u2009nm, meanwhile achieving low sheet resistance (\u2009≤\u200910\u2009Ω sq-1). The UV OLED based on the SAS show competitive device performance. The UV OLED obtains the peak of UV electroluminescence at 376\u2009nm and shows a very high maximum EQE of 4.1% with the maximum output power density of 5.18\u2009mW\u2009cm-2. These results indicate that the potential of SAS applications in deep UV transparent electrodes and large-scale flexible transparent electronics."},
